efused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "The implementer made the changes, and the spec's check passes: `tests/config/loader/test_loader.py` gives 33 passed. I reviewed the diff and it matches the spec.\n\n- **Loader:** `Loader.load` now runs each override value through the new `Loader.substitute` before converting it. `set_env` overrides and loads with no `conf` keep the raw value. The base `substitute` raises `NotImplementedError`.\n- **Ini and TOML:** `IniLoader.substitute` and `TomlLoader.substitute` call `replace` as the spec gives. The ini one sits just before `build`, not after it as the spec says.\n- **Docs:** `docs/reference/config.rst` has the new \"Substitutions inside an override\" subsection. I didn't re-read the new `docs/changelog/4047.bugfix.rst`, which the diff doesn't show because it's untracked; the implementer reports it matches the spec.\n\nThe implementer also ran `tests/config`, which gave 6663 passed and 2 skipped. It left out `tests/config/cli/test_argcomplete.py`, because `argcomplete` isn't installed in `.venv`. Nothing is committed.", "ttft_ms": 1712, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 6397, "uuid": "1d3b10d7-974e-4f33-87f7-2f33a9f8e4f8", "ttft_stream_ms": 1394, "time_to_request_ms": 14, "first_content_frame_ms": 1394, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
